# Ghostty (github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty), the terminal emulator (GTK4 and libadwaita runtime, built with Zig). Pinned by the release
# tag v<semver> and its peeled commit; the tag names `vt-*` (libghostty-vt releases) and `tip` (a nightly) are NOT the terminal and
# are ignored by the weekly check (UPSTREAM_TAG_REGEX). Ghostty publishes no GitHub release objects, only tags.
#
# The source is the publisher's signed release tarball (PACKAGING.md says tarballs hold pre-generated files and need fewer build
# dependencies than a git checkout). The build fails unless the tag still resolves to UPSTREAM_COMMIT, the tarball's minisign
# signature verifies against UPSTREAM_MINISIGN_KEY (the key published in PACKAGING.md) AND the tarball's sha256 is
# UPSTREAM_TARBALL_SHA256. The weekly bump recomputes the sha256 only after the signature verified.
UPSTREAM_REPO=ghostty-org/ghostty
UPSTREAM_TAG=v1.4.0
UPSTREAM_COMMIT=83fb95624b0439ee660c2679b43b38c8b63769cd
UPSTREAM_TAG_REGEX=^v[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+$
UPSTREAM_TARBALL_URL=https://release.files.ghostty.org/@VERSION@/ghostty-@VERSION@.tar.gz
UPSTREAM_MINISIGN_KEY=RWQlAjJC23149WL2sEpT/l0QKy7hMIFhYdQOFy0Z7z7PbneUgvlsnYcV
# sha256 of ghostty-1.4.0.tar.gz, taken by the hub after `minisign -V` verified it against the key above (2026-11-14).
UPSTREAM_TARBALL_SHA256=cb188ac6c3a8278d5fd7bfef15d8c017104c87f638b5560eb38024a71ae0f005

# The Zig toolchain. Fedora 45 packages Zig 0.16 only and Ghostty v1.4.0 needs 0.17 (minimum_zig_version in its build.zig.zon: major
# and minor must be equal, patch at least), so the official release from ziglang.org is downloaded, verified against the signing
# key of ziglang.org and the sha256 below, and unpacked in the builder. build.sh re-reads minimum_zig_version from the source
# and fails when this version does not satisfy it.
ZIG_VERSION=0.17.0
ZIG_URL=https://ziglang.org/download/@VERSION@/zig-x86_64-linux-@VERSION@.tar.xz
# The minisign public key from https://ziglang.org/download/ and the sha256 of the tarball above (equals the shasum in download/index.json);
# both verified by the hub on 2026-11-14 (the signature of the downloaded tarball verified with this key).
ZIG_MINISIGN_KEY=RWSGOq2NVecA2UPNdBUZykf1CCb147pkmdtYxgb3Ti+JO/wCYvhbAb/U
ZIG_SHA256=1cbe9df9f27e6b78d14ccbca43b6703a404ef79ef1c463de901d7f088d4e2026
